{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_10_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a550e4a501c349bff378e41953e5c77023cfee0e63e34748c45fd70ae1cd0f25",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3711e3941b71fce4d78d8aaab629d5b53b4bcf3cd76508043f700295cc0ad363",
      "text": "（这一次，本该把竞争对手羞辱个痛快，\n展现我们砸下重金打造的奢华舞台……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73cf4b21837d3092970edaf172b60cec0718812358a9776478e20af0e31f3fef",
      "text": "（好让世人明白，只有我们才配得上顶点的地位才对……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83aae418bdbc477974f3ef3a84d2cea01ea39a4ba1be4a8699e7bbcc0558ca2f",
      "text": "……可是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0920c31fb2ed3706c0624323a6d51560f9d2d78c13338760fa98187765326a44",
      "text": "我曾经渴望见到的顶尖偶像的身姿……\n真的是那样的东西吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22651f0fe3e7d7eb8ea40c2a1ef07e3f031ee2deea896ef5ef93ec6ae04e5b4c",
      "text": "……我不懂了。如今的我，或许已经既无法找寻，\n也无法亲手孕育出来了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4aa1183c642a8d137ac7cbbc62481733ff316aee4c1ff7166579a1740aef348",
      "text": "……也是啊。顶尖偶像，究竟是什么？\n在场的每个人，恐怕都无法给出一个确切的解释吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c3285e1b152b09bf94d01cf211d76facab07dcef39dca6e6dbed3ccfd0a2a6a",
      "text": "正因如此，大家或许才会在脑海中描摹、憧憬着那个身姿，\n并不顾一切地追逐着它。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcbf16423b8b3d8717afe93015934d00f87f6bc274570d89d2f9b4554fe5b7dc",
      "text": "毕竟偶像的世界，\n就是充满着那么多梦想嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb179799112afba54225c03006ea4a37fab6c3d89e4ba8c88db0825e6396b7b2",
      "text": "怀抱同样梦想的人彼此扶持，\n一起去寻找那究竟是何种模样，好吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6195fce4992d1e13ef1247d1612df72a72718066c49b934546860287d786efd1",
      "text": "信玄先生的肩膀可是很靠得住的哦～。大概就算我和\n另外两三个人一起骑上去，他也能轻轻松松带我们前行呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000183:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c00bb672029662e3e9f6ee4f7b7c76d3b09ea5b4bc92a127ff68509aa74c8ce",
      "text": "呵呵。和这样充满力量、永不言弃、\n无论发生什么都会一直奔跑下去的我们315 Pro一起。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000193:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1936de3fdf26f882a019f84ec6f0605f8b94b52e1751a9a1b171e31d6bb7b8c",
      "text": "让我们再次启程，\n去追逐顶尖偶像这个梦想吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000216:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5a00dd7c292d0ad92c72dda454309a78e313be46670ce75a0cfbf5fa5eb0c9e",
      "text": "……竟然对身为敌人的我都伸出援手，\n真是群厚颜无耻到极点的家伙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000218:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4977fa45d7caf5fc09d16d990b1da289faafa76fa01487a3d41ede7da60c8f87",
      "text": "不过，多亏你们，我醒悟过来了。……谢谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000252:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d1e1079d647135a0beea0c562ffbb2737e4b94129cd78fe963d879de4c655ff",
      "text": "LIVE结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000269:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c149aebf5f47af41c21fd994552353fdd8c567096aae7b8b81184bbafb1228bd",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー？\n我们到庆功宴会场门前了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000271:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:491ecbae0e83dc29b1d6daf7daaf106030d746a99160e82b5e4b23b749c7fb2d",
      "text": "现在在这儿的是男极红和男极猫咪。还有……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000273:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:777e4cae25fa0b87de4f58029a23f5b93805aa226249e8b340bdf70beaaf2c20",
      "text": "男极红是……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000276:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd0ea74c18c4d10a96ed0cdbb82f3e2501a7777e7cf75fec50ea0927346da1f8",
      "text": "啊哈哈，就是那个啦。大家觉得“男极FIVE”\n听起来像英雄的名字，一下子就聊嗨了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000278:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ca6184a85b9018a5fa3f22b1fb30e1a6bcbc3be27fda22ea23e2ccc35be842f",
      "text": "于是就给自己起了个外号，\n或者说是别称之类的代号。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000280:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:917a2ed3daec02552fedcaf129cd084294ebaa2e017e6b78ef34d04281feee06",
      "text": "我是男极红，次郎是男极猫咪。\n然后，还有男极肌肉缝纫机……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000282:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:640c7eafb203569b63697dde53678a739d43029148e0dbab1bd3610eaa61d66d",
      "text": "还有……啊，来了来了！\n男极清洁，还有男极清洁·眼镜！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000284:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a7f41726421feabcc9b0a8824cb34cd9d2359f06d2b3e3c003c777610f1a60c",
      "text": "男极FIVE，全员集结！就这么回事啦。\n聚在路边也不太好，我们先去里面等你们哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000286:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99d01291b51ff811fbb0fd82bdbb35a4f3b3544467d7a2c5838325d02b958321",
      "text": "你们当诱饵时候的事，\n我很期待听你们详细讲讲哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000288:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:130885c08f4390cf6621e0b24e10eaf75cdaa26183c0d22359032d5c57d381e1",
      "text": "我们也有好多事情\n想跟●●●●プロデューサー说呢。那，一会儿见咯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_j:cmd-000298:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b19cab6474e27cc24df0c0cf162678408df4b1e82d08723a3a4f554b83b5c7a6",
      "text": "第2章　拍上门来的挑战书！\n通往顶尖偶像之路　完",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
